The L-cancel flash on the fighter's model (Melee-NX-NetPlay 0.4.7), as melee-unlocked draws it (gx_shader.cpp's player tint): the
flashing slot's skinned model of the perspective camera takes the colour (the looks' one-stage tint, light and shade kept), not
its shadow pass or effects. features/overlays.cpp sets the colour per slot (looks_live.h flash) and asks the game for draw
owners while a renderer flash mode is chosen. Display only. After 0116, against the build-time copy of gx_aurora_bridge.cpp.
